<p>Sher hue do waarde lashkar<br> maqtal mein barpa tha mehshar<br> fakhr se apne sar ko uthakar<br> kehti thi abbas ki khwahar<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(4)<br> ek hai mohammad aur dusra hai aun<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)</p> 
<p>1. Naam hai inke aun o mohammad<br> haider ke akkas hai ye<br> mulk e wafa ke dono makee'n hai<br> dono hi abbas hai ye<br> fatima zehra ke hai nawase<br> mamu par jaa'n dete hai<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)<br> ek hai mohammad aur dusra hai aun<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)</p> 
<p>2. Maine inhe takeed ye ki thi<br> darya par mat jaana tum<br> maqtal mein pyaase hi rehna<br> sabr e ali dikhlana tum<br> waqt e wigha ye bint e asad ki<br> god ke paale lagte hai<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)<br> ek hai mohammad aur dusra hai aun<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)</p> 
<p>3. Aun mohammad se kehta tha<br> bhai bhool na jaana tum<br> hum hai ali akbar ka sadqa<br> amma ka nazrana tum<br> shukre khuda amma ke sajde<br> fakhr se kehte rehte hai<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)<br> ek hai mohammad aur dusra hai aun<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)</p> 
<p>4. Ghar jaana hai khoo'n mein nahake<br> pohche jab khaimo mein laashe<br> khushk zabaa ko dekhke amma<br> kehde hai shehzade pyaase<br> hukm e madar maanne wale<br> marke zinda rehte hai<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)<br> ek hai mohammad aur dusra hai aun<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)</p> 
<p>5. Aun o mohammad ki ye hasrat<br> puri hui zindaan mein jaakar<br> jab waqt e azaadi aaya<br> nauk e sina se utre jab sar<br> boli zainab peet ke sar ko<br> lawaris jo dikhte hai<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)<br> ek hai mohammad aur dusra hai aun<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)</p> 
<p>6. Aun o mohammad jaise bete<br> kaash khuda rehan o raza de<br> fakhr se sar uncha ho maa ka<br> baap kare sajde pe sajde<br> rooh e abu talib ye pukare<br> haider jinko rote hai<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)<br> ek hai mohammad aur dusra hai aun<br> haan ye mere bete hai..(2)</p>